    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d560">

                <pb facs="0787" n="767" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg767"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 8, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I am instructed by her Majesty’s principal
                    secretary of state for foreign affairs to call your attention to the
                    accompanying despatches, with their enclosures, addressed by the lieutenant
                    governor of New Brunswick to her Majesty’s secretary of state for the colonies,
                    relative to some shot fired from a battery in course of construction on a small
                    island near Eastport, between the coast of Maine and Campobello, having fallen
                    upon the British territory of Campobello.</p>
                <pb facs="0788" n="768" xml:id="pg768"/>
                <p>In bringing to your knowledge the circumstances set forth in the enclosed papers
                    I am instructed to state that her Majesty’s government suppose the firing to
                    have been unintentional.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>For LORD LYONS,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>







